{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123784","id":4621891499,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE3x3qw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123784","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123784.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123784.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123784","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123784/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123784/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123784/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3b37409da7c04ff834b721d93f2320825ffa8e1","number":123784,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix Except Bone Transform removing bone tracks on retarget import","user":{"login":"pulppixel","id":26397779,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Mzk3Nzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26397779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel","html_url":"https://github.com/pulppixel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #123782\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nAccording to the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.html#except-bone-transform), Except Bone Transform \"Removes any tracks except the bone Transform track from the animations.\"\r\n\r\nTracks that move bones should be kept, and all other tracks should be removed.\r\nCurrently, the bone tracks are removed as well.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"b_master_on_dialog\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c787da4b-01f7-4420-9d7c-527b600875e7\" />\r\n\r\n**Except Bone Transform: Off**\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"a_master_off_animation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41eb7a09-921e-4d68-9a9c-2e69c2313d53\" />\r\n\r\n**Except Bone Transform: On**\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"b_master_on_animation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7864334e-739f-4387-841e-b8790258873f\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n### Cause\r\n\r\nThe bug is in `PostImportPluginSkeletonTrackOrganizer::internal_process` in `post_import_plugin_skeleton_track_organizer.cpp`.\r\n(This function goes through the tracks one by one and decides whether to keep or remove each one.)\r\n\r\nThis code is at the end of the loop:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (remove_except_bone) {\r\n    remove_indices.push_back(i);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAny track that reaches this point is removed, so only non-bone tracks should get here.\r\nHere's the catch: bone tracks should skip this with `continue`, but two branches don't.\r\n\r\n1. Bone tracks that should be kept reach this point and are removed.\r\n2. Position tracks that `Unimportant Positions` already marked for removal get added to `remove_indices` again here. (With the same index in the list twice, the wrong track gets removed, or an out-of-bounds error occurs.) \r\n\r\n   <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"b_master_on_output\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/301f0346-9417-4513-99d5-968acbf30ecb\" />\r\n\r\n3. The early return at the start of the function doesn't check Except Bone Transform either.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (!remove_positions && separate_unmapped_bones == 0) {\r\n    return;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf the other two options are both off, the function returns early. So with only Except Bone Transform enabled, nothing is removed.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n- 1 and 2: added a `continue` right after the if/else block.\r\n- 3: added `!remove_except_bone` to the early-return condition.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"c_master_fix_on_output\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/112e76a8-dfab-41b4-8727-ec57df466ad8\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"c_master_fix_on_animation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef5fc2f9-fa93-4819-8b9d-25da137614fe\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n### AI usage\r\n\r\nI used an AI assistant to trace the cause, build the MRP, run the before/after tests, take the screenshots, and translate this description from Korean.\r\nI typed the fix myself, and I understand it and can answer questions about it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","htm